WEBVTT

00:13:27.481 --> 00:13:30.663
gecontroleerd door multiplayer

00:13:30.663 --> 00:13:32.614
videospel-motoren

00:13:32.614 --> 00:13:34.365
koraalriffen

00:13:34.365 --> 00:13:36.504
of de visserij controleren.

00:13:36.504 --> 00:13:40.994
We hopen hardwaretechnologie te kunnen gebruiken

00:13:40.994 --> 00:13:44.525
om onze oceanen beter te begrijpen 
en te beschermen.

00:13:44.525 --> 00:13:48.237
Hartelijk dank. (Applaus)

00:13:48.237 --> 00:14:07.499
(Applaus)